@startuml
title Сценарий 4: Финансы


actor "Рекламодатель" as Advertiser
participant "Платёжный\n шлюз" as PG

participant "API\n Gateway" as GW

box "Общее" #FFE8E8
queue "RabbitMQ" as RQ
queue "Kafka" as K
end box

participant "Istio\n Sidecar\n (Financial)" as FSISTIO
box "Financial Service" #E8F1FF
    participant "Transaction\n Worker" as TW
    participant "Credit\n Worker" as CRW
    database "Financial\n DB Primary" as FSDB
    database "Financial\n DB Replica" as FSDBREP
    participant "Financial\n BL" as FSBL
    participant "Financial\n API" as FSAPI
    participant "Contract\n Worker" as CW
end box

== Пополнение бюджета ==

Advertiser -> GW++: [1.1] POST запрос пополнения
    GW -> FSISTIO++: [4.F.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        FSISTIO -> FSAPI++: [4.F.1.1] sidecar forwarding: входящий HTTP-запрос
            FSAPI ->> RQ: [4.F.1.2] Queue Producer: credit
        FSAPI --> FSISTIO--: Accepted
    FSISTIO --> GW--: 202 Accepted
GW --> Advertiser--: 202 Accepted

RQ -> CRW++: [4.F.2] Queue Consumer: credit
    CRW -> FSBL++: [4.F.2.1] Создание пополнения
        FSBL -> FSDB++: [4.F.2.2] JDBC write: create credit
        FSDB --> FSBL--: JDBC write: credit created
    FSBL --> CRW--: ok
    CRW ->> PG: [4.F.3] HTTPS/REST: платёжная транзакция
    alt Timeout
    CRW -> CRW: [4.F.3.1a] timeout
    else
    PG -> GW++: [4.F.3.1] HTTPS/REST: callback
        GW -> FSISTIO++: [4.F.4] HTTPS/REST over mTLS
            FSISTIO -> FSAPI++: [4.F.4.1] sidecar forwarding: входящий callback
                FSAPI ->> RQ: [4.F.4.2] Queue Producer: credit(callback)
                FSAPI --> FSISTIO--: Accepted
            FSISTIO --> GW--: 202 Accepted
    GW --> PG--: 202 Accepted
RQ -> CRW: [4.F.5]Queue Consumer: credit(callback)
    end
alt Timeout или callback(Error)
    CRW -> FSBL++: [4.F.5.a.1] удаление пополнения
        FSBL -> FSDB++: [4.F.5.a.2]JDBC write: delete credit
        FSDB --> FSBL--: JDBC write: credit deleted
    FSBL --> CRW--: ok
alt После 3 retries
CRW ->> RQ: credit(NACK + DLQ)
else
CRW ->> RQ: credit(NACK + requeue с backoff)
end
else callback: OK
    CRW -> FSBL++: [4.F.5.1] обновление пополнения
        FSBL -> FSDB++: [4.F.5.2] JDBC write: update credit
        FSDB --> FSBL--: JDBC write: credit updated
    FSBL --> CRW--: ok
    CRW ->> RQ: [4.F.5.3] Queue Producer: transaction
CRW -> RQ--: credit(ACK)
end

== Идемпотентная транзакция ==

RQ -> TW++:[4.F.6] Queue Consumer: transaction
    TW -> FSBL++:[4.F.6.1] идемпотентная транзакция
        FSBL -> FSDB++:[4.F.6.2] create transaction
        FSDB --> FSBL--: transaction created
        FSBL -> FSDB++:[4.F.6.2.1] update budget
        FSDB --> FSBL--: budget updated
        alt если transaction.type = debit
            FSBL -> FSDB++: [4.F.6.2.2] update account
            FSDB --> FSBL--: account updated
        end
alt ошибка
        FSBL -> FSBL: saga
    FSBL --> TW: ERROR
alt После 3 retries
TW -> RQ: transaction (NACK + DLQ)
else
TW -> RQ: transaction (NACK + requeue с backoff)
end
else успех
        FSBL -> FSDB++:[4.F.6.2.3] update statistic_budget
        FSDB --> FSBL--: statistic_budget updated
        FSBL ->> K:[4.F.6.3] Kafka producer: Событие изменения бюджета (state_budget_changed)
        note right of K: см. Сценарий 5. Обновление кешей
    FSBL --> TW--: OK
TW -> RQ: transaction (ACK)
end

== Просмотр финансов ==

FSDB ->> FSDBREP: [4.F.6.2.1]/[4.F.2.2.1] streaming: репликация
Advertiser -> GW++:[1.1] GET budgets / state_budgets / transactions / accounts
    GW -> FSISTIO++:[4.F.1] HTTPS/REST over mTLS (Istio)
        FSISTIO -> FSAPI++:[4.F.1.1] sidecar forwarding: входящий HTTP-запрос
            FSAPI -> FSDBREP++: [4.F.2(a)] JDBC read
            FSDBREP --> FSAPI--: budgets / statisic_budgets / reserve_budgets / transactions/ accounts
            FSAPI -> FSAPI: [4.F.2(a).1] формирование производных (budgets / statisic_budgets / reserve_budgets -> state_budgets)
        FSAPI --> FSISTIO--: response: budgets / state_budgets / transactions / accounts
    FSISTIO --> GW--: response
GW --> Advertiser--: HTTPS: response

== Контракты ==

K -> CW++: [3.F.1] Kafka Consumer: события контрактов (contract_create / contract_activate / contract_deactivate / contract_completed)
    note left of CW: см. Сценарий 3. Действия с рекламой. Контракты
CW --> K:

@enduml
